A||||9||Shaun41178||Raced a 3rd Gen Vette||||14||
Z||000000||Shaun41178||04-15-2000||01:49 AM||||At the local hangout tongiht and this 3rd gen vette like a 78 or something(kind of like the model in the movie Corvette Summer) pulled into the parking lot and started talking.  It had a wide body kit on it and sidepipes.  Now i don't know what he said but it got the people there pretty riled up.  All I really heard was $500 this and $500 that and he wanted to run a Nova with a "350" ci engine.  Actually the Nova had  like a 460 or some bullsh!t like that.  Needless to say it was a big engine and the guy kept telling the Vette guy that it was  a 350.  i was trying to hold back the laughter and someone was saying titles and $1000 and all this and I couldnt' believe it.  It was nuts.  The guy with the Vette said he had a 350 with a 4 spd<BR>	So The vette guy was about to leave cause I guess he didnt' have the money and before he did i yelled out "I will race you"  I told him i had no money but I will do it for shits and giggles.  he asked what I had and I told him a Fiero "That red one there".  So the guys there were telling us where to go which was up the road a bit so I asked one of the guys to go with me so I went to the right spot.  We get to the intersection and then turn around in a parking lot and wait for no traffic and pull out at the red.  The guy with me used to have a V8 Fiero and a Aluminum block one and a Forged 3.1 crank but has since gotten rid of it which is a bummer.  Anyway i am watching the lights, powerbrake it up, lights turn green and I punch the nitrous right from the line.  Top of first gear I had 2 cars, second gear I was around more then 5 car lengths ahead the guy riding with me said.  i could see him in my rearview pretty well.  Well Funny thing is is that the Nova was behind me at the light and watched me get a nice lead and then punched it and he went flying by me while I was around 70 or so.   I was like Holy #%@# that nova is fast.  So I let off before the designated finish and hit my hazards as I had quite  big lead on this guy and I knew I was clearly the victor and with oncoming traffic and the Nova flying by me I wanted to make it semi-safe again.<BR>	<BR>Well after the race this guy said he had a 427 engine coming for it and needed tranny work and stuff and kind of made excuses and such but still credited me with the win but wish I hadn't of let off early cause he says his 3rd gear is strong and he would have caught me,  Yea right.  If I kept my foot planted I would have kept pulling his ass.  it was Awesome!.  my first Vette kill.  Who says you need cubes to go fast?  Later <P>Shaun<BR>85 GT with nitrous<BR>soon to come:3.2 with aluminum block<BR>just think what it will do with that?<BR>||||reg||14
