Z||000009||Shaun41178||04-17-2000||11:36 PM||||I still have the stock valve body.  I did purchase a shift kit from the Fiero Store but have yet to install it.  i had a guy lined up to do it in his backyard but from what I hear the city shut him down cause he didn't have the proper permits to do backyard car work because he wasnt' charging tax that the city could collect.  Basically it's city greed. However he still might be doing some stuff.  However I find it takes much effort to pick up a phone these days  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Plus I need my car everyday so  giving it up for a day or two would be a bit tough.  Just not what I want right now though.<P>Yea I dont' know if this guy had any mods on his Vette but he still got smoked.  Sure he might have only had around 200 hp but he still got beat by a V6 and a Fiero at that  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
